# Install scripts that this project genuinely needs, versioned so CI matches a laptop.
#
# npm 11+ blocks package install scripts unless a package is allow-listed. Without this file
# the policy comes from each developer's ~/.npmrc — and on CI there is no ~/.npmrc at all, so
# nothing is allowed and Electron's postinstall never downloads its binary. The E2E job then
# dies with a bare `spawn .../electron/dist/electron ENOENT`, which names the symptom rather
# than the cause.
#
# electron            no lifecycle script in v44; listed here so the binary-download step in
#                     ci.yml is the only thing that fetches it
# better-sqlite3      native module, needs its prebuild or a build
# esbuild              postinstall places its platform binary
# @tailwindcss/oxide   native binary for the Tailwind engine
allow-scripts=electron,better-sqlite3,esbuild,@tailwindcss/oxide